P1 argo creates another namespace
    ryft-namespaces: P1: Argo CD may write only the Namespaces ryft-web and rabbitmq-system, and deletes none.
P1 argocd namespace privileged
    ryft-namespaces: P1: a RYFT, rabbitmq-system or argocd Namespace must carry Pod Security enforce, warn and audit set to restricted.
P1 enforce baseline
    ryft-namespaces: P1: a RYFT, rabbitmq-system or argocd Namespace must carry Pod Security enforce, warn and audit set to restricted.
P1 generateName ryft- without labels
    ryft-namespaces: P1: a RYFT, rabbitmq-system or argocd Namespace must carry Pod Security enforce, warn and audit set to restricted.
P1 label missing
    ryft-namespaces: P1: a RYFT, rabbitmq-system or argocd Namespace must carry Pod Security enforce, warn and audit set to restricted.
P1 version label pinned
    ryft-namespaces: P1: Pod Security version labels must be absent or latest.
P10 admin sync manifests
    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync operation must not carry local manifests or a source of its own.
P10 controller sync with a source that is not the app's
    ryft-argocd-operation: P10: a sync operation must not carry local manifests or a source of its own.
