P11 other registry
    ryft-broker: P11: the RabbitmqCluster must live in ryft-rabbitmq and run the digest-pinned broker image.
P11 override service
    ryft-broker: P11: spec.override may only set the pod-template annotations prometheus.io/path, port and scrape.
P11 override with containers
    ryft-broker: P11: spec.override may only set the pod-template annotations prometheus.io/path, port and scrape.
P11 rabbitmqcluster elsewhere
    ryft-broker: P11: the RabbitmqCluster must live in ryft-rabbitmq and run the digest-pinned broker image.
P11 secretBackend
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker takes no secretBackend (Vault or external secrets): its credentials come from the Secrets VSO writes.
P11 secretBackend a key the chart does not know
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker takes no secretBackend (Vault or external secrets): its credentials come from the Secrets VSO writes.
P11 secretBackend externalSecret named
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker takes no secretBackend (Vault or external secrets): its credentials come from the Secrets VSO writes.
P11 secretBackend externalSecret with another field
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker takes no secretBackend (Vault or external secrets): its credentials come from the Secrets VSO writes.
P11 secretBackend vault next to the defaulted externalSecret
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker takes no secretBackend (Vault or external secrets): its credentials come from the Secrets VSO writes.
P11 service LoadBalancer
    ryft-broker: P11: the broker's Service must stay ClusterIP.
P11 shovel
    ryft-broker: P11: Shovels, Federations and SchemaReplications are not allowed.
