P3 allow-all ingress rule
    ryft-netpol: P3: every NetworkPolicy rule needs ports (each with a port) and a peer.
P3 another range in the broker
    ryft-netpol: P3: endPort is allowed only for the broker's node-to-node range 35672-35682, on a rule whose peers are podSelectors.
P3 default-deny narrowed
    ryft-netpol: P3: default-deny must select every pod, list Ingress and Egress and hold no rules.
P3 default-deny with a rule
    ryft-netpol: P3: default-deny must select every pod, list Ingress and Egress and hold no rules.
P3 default-deny with only Ingress
    ryft-netpol: P3: default-deny must select every pod, list Ingress and Egress and hold no rules.
P3 egress world on 22
    ryft-netpol: P3: an egress ipBlock must be 0.0.0.0/0 with the private ranges excepted on 443/5432, or the broker's 443 rule.
P3 egress world with 4 excepts
